00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:38.360
They had just raised $950 million. What happened?&nbsp;
Even though the company was losing money,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:44.040
they paid out over $800 million to&nbsp;
insiders, including 300 million to Levski.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:50.880
But something else was happening at Groupon.&nbsp;
They were leaning into some unique marketing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:57.720
something that could hurt their IPO. In February&nbsp;
